+# mac-d0016 evidence
+
+Base: `fcb5881`, merging yg-unix-ring `2c7cead` with the Mac port. Game inputs are
+unchanged, from `<data-drive>/build-out/melee-ports/mu-b0017-linux-game-nosp`.
+All runs were offline, directly authorized by the task, with at most four compiler
+jobs. Game checks used `check_full.py`, isolated profiles, muted headless execution,
+and `<data-drive>/build-out/test-discs/GALE01r2.iso`.
+
+Both `MELEE_GAME_LIBRARY=... python3 -B port/mac/build_full.py --agent-test-hook`
+and the same command without the hook flag succeeded. The existing source glob and
+include paths already compile the macOS pad mirror and POSIX attachment parser.
+No source-list change was needed.
+
+The dev spike requires the exact value `MELEE_MAC_DEV_SPIKE=1`, and rejects
+`--vanilla-only` with exit 2 before initialization. It still compiles with the
+`build.sh` compiler arguments. Six startup checks passed via
+`check_full.checked_run`, including the supported development help path.
+Packaging now requires the hash-bound build manifest to identify
+`port/mac/build_full.py` and `port/app/main.cpp`. Two packaging regression tests
+passed, including three missing/spike provenance cases and a changed binary.
+
+## Results
+
+* Hook absence check: hook exit **1** (expected); release exit **0**.
+* Hook `check_full.py unit`: **47/47**.
+* Hook parity: **7,200/7,200** match frames, **76** fields/frame, **0** differing
+  values; 9,000 total digest rows.
+* Hook memory-card: **PASS**, decisions **5, 7**, saved vanilla-only card.
+* POSIX ENet ring: **PASS** on **arm64 and x86_64**, including the full
+  helper-relayed connect/send/receive/disconnect test; no native network dispatch.
+* POSIX pad mirror: **PASS** on **arm64 and x86_64**; also in the unit suite.
+* YouGame transport: **PASS** on **arm64 and x86_64**, including lock-free
+  `Stream::closed()` during event waits.
+* `yougame_merge_test.py`: **7/7** after correcting its stale assertion to require
+  the hardened `apply_fight` signature, live room state, and logger.
+* Policy/source suite: **6/6** after that assertion correction.
+* `git diff --check`: **PASS**. No command was refused or timed out.
+
+## Artifact
+
+`dist/exp16/MeleeUnlocked.app` is the **STAGING ONLY** hook build; its host matches
+`build-mac-full-hook/MeleeUnlocked` byte for byte. `entitlements.plist` is beside
+the app and matches the exp13 input. The two Sys deltas are in `Resources/deltas`;
+neither `GameSetup_gui.dat` nor `slpCSS.dat` occurs anywhere in the bundle. There
+are no symlinks. Codesign inspection confirms the app is not signed at all.
+Nothing was signed, uploaded, seeded, or committed.
+
+* Host architecture: **x86_64**.
+* Host size: **8,900,288 bytes**.
+* Host SHA-256: `f93db79a2bd8250177eb623ef8d84d7536acd2a7a4399be49dbb8546b0677529`.
+* Bundle regular-file bytes: **54,042,746**.
+
+Build/check/package logs and `artifact.json` are in the worktree's `evidence/`;
+individual isolated test logs and JSON results are under
+`build-mac-full-hook/checks/`. The first policy log preserves the stale assertion
+failure; `policies-rerun.log` records the passing rerun.
+
+Proposed commit: `mac: d0016 staging hook build and dev-spike loader gates`.
